# Shell scripts run on Linux (the Monash box, the deploy simulator, CI) but are
# edited on Windows, where core.autocrlf hands the working tree CRLF. A CRLF
# heredoc terminator or shebang is a syntax error there, so keep them LF on
# every platform.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
